---
# Repo convention: role names are kebab-case (shard-listener, mc-router, …) —
# established across every playbook, doc, and downstream tooling long before
# ansible-lint 25 began enforcing the snake_case role-name pattern. Renaming the
# roles would break every consumer for zero behavioural gain, so the rule is
# skipped. Everything else stays enforced.
skip_list:
  - role-name
